## Offramp API Endpoints

The Offramp API has the following endpoints:

| Method                                                                                             | Description                                                                                                                                              |
| :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| [Session Token](/onramp-&-offramp/offramp-apis/generating-offramp-url)                             | **Required starting 7/31/2025**: Provides a secure way for the client to initialize the Onramp and Offramp widget.                                       |
| [Offramp Config](/onramp-&-offramp/onramp-apis/countries-&-currencies)                             | Returns list of countries supported by Coinbase Offramp, and the payment methods available in each country.                                              |
| [Offramp Options](/onramp-&-offramp/onramp-apis/countries-&-currencies)                            | Returns supported fiat currencies and available crypto assets that can be passed into the Offramp Quote API.                                             |
| [Offramp Quote](/onramp-&-offramp/offramp-apis/generating-offramp-url)                             | Provides a quote based on the asset the user would like to sell, plus the network, the crypto amount, the cashout currency, payment method, and country. |
| [Transaction Status](/onramp-&-offramp/offramp-apis/transaction-status#offramp-transaction-status) | Real time transaction status updates.                                                                                                                    |
| [Transactions](/onramp-&-offramp/offramp-apis/transaction-status#offramp-transactions)             | Historical transaction status.                                                                                                                           |

<Tip>
